  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759221,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "# 1001 Crosswords: A Puzzle Fan's Dream\n\nChallenge yourself with *1001 Crosswords* for the Nintendo DS, a definitive collection featuring a vast library of crosswords from the UK's leading national newspapers. Whether you're a seasoned solver or a curious newcomer, this game offers something for everyone with a diverse selection of Quick and Cryptic puzzles, catering to all skill levels.\n\nDive into hundreds of hours of gameplay, tackling an incredible 1001 puzzles designed to challenge, confound, and ultimately enlighten.  Utilize the built-in keyboard or leverage the stylus for a more tactile writing experience.  Feeling competitive? Engage in timed crossword duels against a friend and test your puzzle prowess. Stuck on a tricky clue?  The Hint button provides assistance, though be mindful of the time penalty! \n\nFully compatible with Nintendo DS, Nintendo DSi, and Nintendo 3DS, *1001 Crosswords* is the ultimate crossword experience, perfect for puzzle enthusiasts seeking a substantial and engaging challenge."
    },
